@(D.14 = 14-27) @q{“My bride, you should not weave cloth for me! ……, you should not spin yarn for me! ……, you should not comb out goat's wool for me! ……, you should not warp threads for me!”}  @gap{3 lines fragmentary}  @q[Dumuzid,Inana]{“You should not (?) …… bread for me!”} @wDN{Ninegala}, ……. The wild bull @wDN{Dumuzid} ……. …… holy radiance on the horizon ……, …… radiance in heaven ……,  @gap{2 lines fragmentary}   @gap{up to 5 lines missing} 
